   "description": "<div><b>User Story:</b><br /></div><div><b>As</b> a system administrator ,<br /></div><div><b>I want</b> to integrate the application with a central identity provider,<br /></div><div><b>So that</b> users can log in using a unified, secure, and centralized authentication system.<br /></div><div><br /></div><div><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b><br /></div><p style=\"margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\"><span style=\"\">1.<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><b>Authentication Flow:</b><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: Symbol\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span style=\"\">·<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span>Users must be redirected to\nthe central identity provider for login.<br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: Symbol\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span style=\"\">·<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span>Upon successful\nauthentication, the user is redirected back with a valid token/session.<br /></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\"><span style=\"\">2.<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><b>SSO Support:</b><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: Symbol\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span style=\"\">·<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span>Users should be able to log\nin once and access all integrated systems without re-authenticating.<br /></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\"><span style=\"\">3.<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><b>Token Validation:</b><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: Symbol\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span style=\"\">·<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span>The application must\nvalidate identity tokens (e.g., JWT, SAML, OAuth2) from the central provider.<br /></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\"><span style=\"\">4.<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><b>Role and Permission Mapping:</b><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: Symbol\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span style=\"\">·<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span>Roles or groups from the\nidentity provider should be mapped correctly to in-app permissions.<br /></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in\"><span style=\"\">5.<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><b>Security Compliance:</b><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: Symbol\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span style=\"\">·<span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span>Token expiration, refresh\nmechanisms, and secure storage must comply with industry standards.<br /></p><div><br /></div>",
